# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:3
translate italian u20p_1b7a0d04:

    # "For now, I should go see Mi-Cha."
    "Per ora, dovrei andare a trovare Mi-Cha."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:6
translate italian u20p_6c85aa97:

    # "I drive over to Mi-Cha's dorm and knock on her door, trying to be quiet so I don't wake up anyone else."
    "Guido fino al dormitorio di Mi-Cha e busso alla sua porta, cercando di fare piano per non svegliare nessun altro."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:10
translate italian u20p_a016dbb5:

    # "After a few moments, Mi-Cha opens the door."
    "Dopo qualche istante, Mi-Cha apre la porta."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:11
translate italian u20p_78132b1d:

    # mc "[pcname]! Oh my God, it's you!"
    mc "[pcname]! Oh mio Dio, sei tu!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:14
translate italian u20p_29857b39:

    # "She practically leaps into my arms, wrapping me in a tight embrace."
    "Mi salta praticamente tra le braccia, stringendomi forte."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:15
translate italian u20p_daf29bbf:

    # mc "I missed you so much!"
    mc "Mi sei mancata tantissimo!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:16
translate italian u20p_48732134:

    # pc "I missed you too, Mi-Cha."
    pc "Anche tu mi sei mancata, Mi-Cha."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:19
translate italian u20p_6c2a8295:

    # mc "What happened? Did the thing you were trying to do work?"
    mc "Che cosa è successo? Ha funzionato quello che stavi cercando di fare?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:20
translate italian u20p_f4fa6482:

    # pc "Yes it did. I didn't mean to be gone so long, but it worked."
    pc "Sì, ha funzionato. Non volevo stare via così a lungo, ma ha funzionato."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:21
translate italian u20p_48ae30e6:

    # pc "I'll tell you all about it tomorrow."
    pc "Te lo racconterò tutto domani."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:22
translate italian u20p_556bcc63:

    # mc "But you are here now? You won't leave me again?"
    mc "Ma ora sei qui? Non mi lascerai di nuovo?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:23
translate italian u20p_39bfeeda:

    # pc "No, I'm not going anywhere."
    pc "No, non vado da nessuna parte."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:26
translate italian u20p_8253f92f:

    # mc "I am so glad you came home."
    mc "Sono così felice che tu sia tornata a casa."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:27
translate italian u20p_6d3a55c4:

    # mc "I didn't know what to do without you."
    mc "Non sapevo cosa fare senza di te."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:30
translate italian u20p_b55a59c5:

    # "She leans in and kisses me softly."
    "Si avvicina e mi bacia dolcemente."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:31
translate italian u20p_d17bdb85:

    # mc "I love you so much."
    mc "Ti amo tantissimo."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20p.rpy:32
translate italian u20p_5735beae:

    # pc "I love you too, Mi-Cha."
    pc "Ti amo anch’io, Mi-Cha."

